and and solve more than 65 puzzles to learn your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.poster.avif?t=1785533713\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.webm?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/69848562b0b411330b164a55aef8f86f.mp4?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truck takes your parking place? No problem, you can forklift them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Kei Cars on the right parking spots,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can have alarms, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And might be Wired, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be smart about parking gates,  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use illegal moves when no one sees, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But sometimes you can Help others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they will show you how to cook Ramen?  Of course using a forklift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.poster.avif?t=1785533713\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.webm?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/c2d5acb20b6d7e7875e9367ee88e8ada.mp4?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elegant forklift straight from Japan (that's you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of kei cars to stick on the fork,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated beep button (!!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/a952b6a615156c4738ee3ffbf65178d3.poster.avif?t=1785533713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/a952b6a615156c4738ee3ffbf65178d3.webm?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/a952b6a615156c4738ee3ffbf65178d3.mp4?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/445228c3b5fde11cfd3f4ba8a01099b2.poster.avif?t=1785533713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/445228c3b5fde11cfd3f4ba8a01099b2.webm?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476650/extras/445228c3b5fde11cfd3f4ba8a01099b2.mp4?t=1785533713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>When all you have is a Forklift, everything looks like palete.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_parag